@deutschetelekom @agi_inc @Techweek_ @a16z What I learned at SF Tech Week: the next wave of smart glasses may be bought for the look, with the AI inside.

Terry Schussler @schussler, Senior Director, Next Generation Devices at Deutsche Telekom, on the panel at AGI, Inc.'s Devices x AI Pitch Night: "If you look at what Meta did at Meta Connect, is they just massively expanded the style parameters. The same product, slightly modified, but with lots more choices, with fashion brands"

His forecast: "You're going to see a ton of that over the next 18 months. Massive volumes of companies that are brand-centric bringing out fashion statements."

The line that sums it up: "we're going to go from AI glasses to glasses that have AI."

And the choice he expects buyers to make: "the fashion aspect of it, is going to become a dominant choice, not the AI."

